---
description: TravelIsrael App Router pages and routes
globs: app/**
alwaysApply: false
---
# Public Routes
/                    → home (hero, popular trips, wizard link)
/trips               → trip discovery (filters, sort, infinite scroll)
/trips/[id]          → trip detail
/trips/create        → create trip
/trips/[id]/edit     → edit trip
/places/[id]         → place detail
/trails/[id]         → trail detail
/wizard              → matching wizard (7 steps)
/wizard/results      → match results

# User Routes
/profile             → personal area
/profile/trips       → my trips by status

# Admin Routes
/admin               → admin dashboard
/admin/trips         → manage trips
/admin/places        → manage places
/admin/trails        → manage trails
/admin/reports       → reports
/admin/users         → users

# Page Patterns
- Server Components with searchParams for URL-based filtering
- loading.tsx skeletons per route group
- error.tsx and not-found.tsx per route group
- Hebrew metadata for SEO
